   121	### 2.3 The ruling, its base, and its fibres
   122	
   123	The Miyanishi--Sugie cylinder theorem together with the standard
   124	cylinder-to-global-fibration extension for smooth affine surfaces yields an
   125	actual surjective morphism on all of `U`,
