   102	the normalizer of G in GL(2, C) (see theorem 5.3). Consequently, N(G) coincides with
   103	the normalizer of G in the full automorphism group Aut(A2 ). As an example, we describe
   104	explicitly the affine lines on the quaternion surface X = A2 /Q8 .
